Z||000009||1FST2M6||08-10-2000||08:57 PM||||SHA! i wish.. 281hp 302 2400lb car tiny 5.5" wide wires.. so sweet! Shops customers car.. I got to sit in it though...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   single 2.25" exhaust with resonator and LONG muffler.. shes super quiet... owners like 50+, pilot with Delta. Also drive a COOL MG-TD with a WOODEN frame! thinks its a TD.. might be a TC.. either way its cool... he won't let ANYONE but Ed (mech) and himself touch that... the frame looks like a dinning room table.. shiney and clean and finished PERFECT! I'm sure worth more than my house...   OOOH anyone want a Jag.. its a  1974 Jaguar XJ-12L it's got one bad head (dropped a valve) it's Saffron on Parchment. 71k miles. $2000. ||||reg||1
